WEBVTT

00:45:56.621 --> 00:46:02.204
who had to break his heart and her own
in order to live the life that she,

00:46:02.204 --> 00:46:06.121
for whatever inexplicable reason that
was still kind of, you know,

00:46:06.121 --> 00:46:09.496
beyond her explanation, had to
trust herself to do that.

00:46:10.413 --> 00:46:15.538
And so I went in and reinhabited that and
and as I was writing, for example,

00:46:15.538 --> 00:46:20.371
that scene in Wild, where my husband
and I are decided to get divorced

00:46:20.371 --> 00:46:23.079
and then we get divorced and we're
saying goodbye to each other.

00:46:23.246 --> 00:46:26.371
You know, I was just sobbing
as I was writing it.

00:46:26.996 --> 00:46:33.788
And even though it's actually not sad,
like it's actually not sad to me now.